# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# EXPERIMENT OUTPUTS (v12.3, for the public GitHub repository)
#   Committed: the paper's analysis results (outputs/review_v12 without trajectories), the oracle cache, the run index and
#   the small language-interface / temperature results. NOT committed: the raw model runs (outputs/raw, ~480 MB) -> they go
#   to Zenodo as CA-CLP_raw_runs.zip (see RELEASE.md); dry-run outputs; per-flight trajectories (regenerated by the scripts).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
outputs/raw/
outputs_dryrun/
outputs/review_v12/simulation/*/trajectories/
outputs/logs/
outputs/free_run/RESULTS_TO_SEND.zip
outputs/free_run/log.txt
# per-run tables and plots of the raw runs: regenerated by `python process_raw.py` from the raw runs on Zenodo
outputs/processed/
outputs/figures/
outputs/**/*.zip
outputs/**/*.tar.gz
*.latest
/*.zip

# LaTeX build files (paper.pdf is kept)
paper/*.aux
paper/*.fdb_latexmk
paper/*.fls
paper/*.out
paper/*.synctex.gz
paper/paper_flat.tex

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DATA: the Bengaluru buildings + SRTM tile and the samples ARE committed (the 3D benchmark needs them).
#   data/real/airports.csv is downloaded by `python run.py real` and is not committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
benchmark/maps/
benchmark/raw/*
!benchmark/raw/.gitkeep
data/real/*
!data/real/.gitkeep

